lthy in production before, so no change-manager approval is needed. I can do it as soon as you reply.", "context": {}}, {"t_ms": 277582, "event": "human_response", "actor": "human", "escalation": "esc1", "decision": "answer", "message": "It's payments-worker - the API errors are downstream of the worker.", "latency_ms": 254847, "hint": {"service": "payments-worker"}, "erred": false}, {"t_ms": 277582, "event": "principal_reply", "actor": "human", "text": "It's payments-worker - the API errors are downstream of the worker."}, {"t_ms": 281796, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01CCCX1JDDaUQck6XUZGGFiS", "tool": "rollback", "args": {"service": "payments-worker", "version": "v3.3.0"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 285796, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01CCCX1JDDaUQck6XUZGGFiS", "tool": "rollback", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 285796, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01CCCX1JDDaUQck6XUZGGFiS", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 285796, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01NLukAaNZweScUZ9bz5Dqb4", "tool": "create_incident", "args": {"title": "payments-worker v3.4.0 errors after deploy; rolled back to v3.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "payments-worker", "summary": "payments-worker v3.4.0 (deployed this morning to us-east, us-west, eu-west) became unhealthy with an 18% error rate. payments-api (v5.1.0, degraded, 18% errors) is affected downstream. Rolled payments-worker back to v3.3.0, its last release that was healthy in production. Monitoring for recovery of payments-worker and payments-api.", "idempotency_key": "payments-worker-v3.4.0-rollback-sev2"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 286396, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01NLukAaNZweScUZ9bz5Dqb4", "tool": "cr