as its last release that was healthy in production. Its error rate dropped from 18% to 0.2%, and it now reports healthy.\n- **Incident:** I opened **INC-0001** (SEV2) for `payments-worker`, and on-call has been paged. The summary describes the bad v3.4.0 deploy, the rollback and the effect on `payments-api`.\n\n**Still a problem:** When I checked right after the rollback, `payments-api` (v5.1.0) was still unhealthy, with an 18% error rate. It may just need a little time to catch up now that the worker is fixed. If its errors don't come down soon, v5.1.0 may have its own bug, since its deploy history also lists that release as degraded.\n\nI haven't touched `payments-api`. If it doesn't recover, I can roll it back to v5.0.0, its last healthy release.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_017jFtbBC7wdUx6FFkCbL5Cd", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01ERSD4gvLGziXvyNg8GbqAE", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01GSdvmXR8W4kvCHwKxVQSU9", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_015Kr5BAxazNWzASXjMmhMpR", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01Y9jZD8UcCKsEuH3v3agCJB", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments-service"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01XbPHgBD9NYSj6DdCy19iCV", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "paym